{
  "description": "Planner questions for the planning agent. 'dev' cases were written together with the rule baseline; 'holdout' cases were written afterwards with paraphrases, English, numbers in words and multi-part requests. Both splits were written by the same author, so holdout is a robustness probe, not an independent test. Gold numbers are recomputed by the engine at evaluation time.",
  "cases": [
    {"id": "D01", "split": "dev", "question": "介绍一下 ASML 备件网络有哪些运输线路，各自运力多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["describe_network"], "expect_args": {"describe_network": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "lane", "network": "asml", "lane": "NL_ocean", "field": "weekly_capacity_kg"},
               {"kind": "lane", "network": "asml", "lane": "NL_air", "field": "weekly_capacity_kg"}]},
    {"id": "D02", "split": "dev", "question": "Marvell 芯片网络的线路和单位排放是什么情况？",
     "expect_tools": ["describe_network"], "expect_args": {"describe_network": {"network": "marvell"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "lane", "network": "marvell", "lane": "TW_air", "field": "kgco2e_per_kg"}]},
    {"id": "D03", "split": "dev", "question": "如果红海航线中断，ASML 备件的物流成本和排放会怎样变化？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"},
               {"kind": "change", "metric": "emissions_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"}]},
    {"id": "D04", "split": "dev", "question": "台风导致台湾港口关闭，对芯片物流成本有什么影响？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "marvell", "scenario": "typhoon"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "marvell", "scenario": "typhoon"}]},
    {"id": "D05", "split": "dev", "question": "马来西亚到新加坡边境拥堵会让成本增加多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "marvell", "scenario": "border_congestion"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "marvell", "scenario": "border_congestion"}]},
    {"id": "D06", "split": "dev", "question": "ASML 备件需求激增 30%（第8到16周），成本会涨多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "scenario": "demand_surge"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "demand_surge"}]},
    {"id": "D07", "split": "dev", "question": "如果 ASML 网络要减排 25%，物流成本会增加多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "carbon_cap_pct": 75}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "normal", "carbon_cap_pct": 75}]},
    {"id": "D08", "split": "dev", "question": "芯片网络把排放控制在 80% 以内，成本代价是多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "marvell", "carbon_cap_pct": 80}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "marvell", "scenario": "normal", "carbon_cap_pct": 80}]},
    {"id": "D09", "split": "dev", "question": "ASML 网络的边际减排成本曲线是怎样的？",
     "expect_tools": ["carbon_frontier"], "expect_args": {"carbon_frontier": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "frontier", "network": "asml", "field": "max_reduction_pct"}]},
    {"id": "D10", "split": "dev", "question": "红海中断有 25% 的概率发生，ASML 应该怎么对冲？值不值得提前预留空运舱位？",
     "expect_tools": ["hedge_disruption_risk"], "expect_args": {"hedge_disruption_risk": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "hedge", "network": "asml", "scenarios": ["normal", "red_sea"], "probabilities": [75, 25], "field": "VSS_usd"}]},
    {"id": "D11", "split": "dev", "question": "在不确定会不会发生中断的情况下，ASML 的随机规划对冲方案价值多少（VSS 和 EVPI）？",
     "expect_tools": ["hedge_disruption_risk"], "expect_args": {"hedge_disruption_risk": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "hedge", "network": "asml", "field": "VSS_usd"},
               {"kind": "hedge", "network": "asml", "field": "EVPI_usd"}]},
    {"id": "D12", "split": "dev", "question": "为什么红海中断后 ASML 成本上升？瓶颈在哪里？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "explain_plan"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"}]},
    {"id": "D13", "split": "dev", "question": "船公司通知：第5到10周海运延误3周，舱位削减40%。对 ASML 备件有什么影响？",
     "expect_tools": ["create_scenario", "solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"create_scenario": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml",
                "custom": {"disruptions": [{"mode": "ocean", "start_week": 5, "end_week": 10, "extra_lead_weeks": 3, "capacity_change_pct": -40}]}}]},
    {"id": "D14", "split": "dev", "question": "帮我订一张明天去新加坡的机票", "expect_tools": [], "expect_refusal": true},
    {"id": "H01", "split": "holdout", "question": "Carriers are rerouting Asia-Europe sailings around Africa because of attacks on shipping. What does that do to our Singapore spare-parts logistics cost and emissions?",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea"}]},
    {"id": "H02", "split": "holdout", "question": "红海如果出事，同时还要减排 20%，ASML 的成本比现在高多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea", "carbon_cap_pct": 80}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "red_sea", "carbon_cap_pct": 80}]},
    {"id": "H03", "split": "holdout", "question": "What would it cost to cut our chip network's emissions by 30 percent?",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "marvell", "carbon_cap_pct": 70}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "marvell", "scenario": "normal", "carbon_cap_pct": 70}]},
    {"id": "H04", "split": "holdout", "question": "Which lane in the ASML network is the most carbon-intensive per kg shipped?",
     "expect_tools": ["describe_network"], "expect_args": {"describe_network": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "lane", "network": "asml", "lane": "NL_air", "field": "kgco2e_per_kg"}]},
    {"id": "H05", "split": "holdout", "question": "A typhoon shuts Taiwan's ports completely in weeks 6-7 and halves Taiwan air capacity in the same weeks. What is the cost impact on the chip network?",
     "expect_tools": ["create_scenario", "solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"create_scenario": {"network": "marvell"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "marvell",
                "custom": {"disruptions": [{"lanes": ["TW_ocean"], "start_week": 6, "end_week": 7, "capacity_change_pct": -100},
                                           {"lanes": ["TW_air"], "start_week": 6, "end_week": 7, "capacity_change_pct": -50}]}}]},
    {"id": "H06", "split": "holdout", "question": "There's maybe a 40% chance the Red Sea route closes. Should we reserve extra air capacity now, and what is planning for it worth?",
     "expect_tools": ["hedge_disruption_risk"], "expect_args": {"hedge_disruption_risk": {"network": "asml"}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "hedge", "network": "asml", "scenarios": ["normal", "red_sea"], "probabilities": [60, 40], "field": "VSS_usd"}]},
    {"id": "H07", "split": "holdout", "question": "ASML 减排40%以后，哪些线路成了瓶颈？碳约束的影子价格是多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "explain_plan"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "carbon_cap_pct": 60}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "shadow", "network": "asml", "scenario": "normal", "carbon_cap_pct": 60}]},
    {"id": "H08", "split": "holdout", "question": "中断了怎么办？", "expect_tools": [], "expect_clarification": true},
    {"id": "H09", "split": "holdout", "question": "What will TSMC's revenue be next year?", "expect_tools": [], "expect_refusal": true},
    {"id": "H10", "split": "holdout", "question": "如果第8到16周需求涨三成，同时把排放压到原来的80%，ASML 成本会比现在高多少？",
     "expect_tools": ["solve_plan", "compare_plans"], "expect_args": {"solve_plan": {"network": "asml", "carbon_cap_pct": 80}},
     "facts": [{"kind": "change", "metric": "cost_change_pct", "network": "asml", "scenario": "demand_surge", "carbon_cap_pct": 80}]}
  ]
}
